  "description": "Pragmatic, database-agnostic authentication facade for ASP.NET Core: hardened JSON endpoints for SPAs and mobile apps (cookies or JWT, refresh-token rotation, server-side sessions, 2FA/TOTP, OAuth/OIDC, invitations, API keys) on top of the framework's own handlers – without Identity tables, generics or base classes. You keep your database and your user model. Native AOT compatible.",
